{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火一年，《集誌社》再次訪問曾經受訪的遺屬。一年後眾人的生活怎渡過。居於宏泰閣七樓的歐陽先生，在火災失去妻子，這一年，他要兼顧工作、照顧兒子阿諾。阿諾升小學，歐陽先生學習父兼母職，他說，「媽咪做過啲乜嘢，佢都會喺隔離。你話唔開心一定有，細路成長你都想太太喺隔離睇住佢大。」他自言是位不合格父親，但仍然希望做好太太臨終所托。<br/><br/>周三晚上的悼念彌撒，阿諾在爸爸懷中睡著了，醒來，懂事的阿諾為爸爸拭淚。在彌撒的心意卡上，歐陽生寫道：「太太，我照你說話做，我冇放棄，一路照顧阿諾。我會做到最好。愛你，王思懿。」</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-2-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-3-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-4-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-5-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-6-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-7-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-8-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-9-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261125_WanFuk_FatherandSon-10-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:03:54.801972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:06:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:12.867843+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:57:15.425492+00:00","content_hash":"76a651be9998356048f4a426690f19cae279fe2faed81f7025a668e62fadbd1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}